{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what a \u201cperfect\u201d college life feels like?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or how your choices could define the ending to your very own university story?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wanna Sleep All Day, But...</i></strong>\u00a0is a Chinese university life sim where you manage stats, make choices, and shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study hard or slack off, prep for grad school or jump into a job\u2014build the life you want, or burn out trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey, your rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/3a7b82fe29bb6269381f21fe9194329b.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your future\u2014<strong>grad school, research programs, civil service exams</strong>, or <strong>early employment</strong>. Or take alternative paths: <strong>study abroad, deliver food, or simply coast through college life</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path comes with its own storylines, challenges, and choices. How you plan\u2014and how you act\u2014will shape the journey ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/c075246313d56ede51a9beab1be219db.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attend lectures</strong> in the classroom building, <strong>join research projects</strong> in the faculty halls, <strong>cram in the library</strong>, or <strong>scroll endlessly through dorm forums</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for the campus culture festival</strong> with your club, spend your summer <strong>doing internships or rural teaching</strong>, <strong>work part-time</strong> at convenience stores, race through the city <strong>delivering food</strong>, or <strong>binge-shop online</strong> during China\u2019s famous \u201cDouble Eleven\u201d sale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can imagine\u2014and more\u2014is here to be experienced.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/f633c091ef7ad90c3f3476bd8b666ecb.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1054 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your university journey, you\u2019ll encounter a diverse cast of characters, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and introverted roommate,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dazzling and accomplished senior,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and outgoing high school friend,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative and cultured peer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships through daily interactions on campus, evolving from acquaintances to close companions. As your bonds deepen, each character\u2019s unique storyline will unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond their personal arcs, these characters play key roles in both main and side storylines, growing alongside you as you shape your university experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind, Chill, or Burn Out \u2014 It\u2019s All Up to You</strong><br> Upgrade your stats through everyday choices. Balance classes, part-time jobs, social life, and rest.<br> <br><strong>Will you rise as a campus legend... or quietly fade into the background?  </strong><br> <br><br><strong>Your college story is yours to write.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2898700?t=1773125094","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2898700?t=1773125094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/fa240c489f47940917b5668132acec8eb91adf14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773125094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/fa240c489f47940917b5668132acec8eb91adf14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773125094","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3832340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>CONTACT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on X at @HyCubeGame for the latest updates and dev news!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what a \u201cperfect\u201d college life feels like?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or how your choices could define the ending to your very own university story?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wanna Sleep All Day, But...</i></strong>\u00a0is a Chinese university life sim where you manage stats, make choices, and shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study hard or slack off, prep for grad school or jump into a job\u2014build the life you want, or burn out trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey, your rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/3a7b82fe29bb6269381f21fe9194329b.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/57cadeaf98bbd59b4e9e5cb7acceca5b.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your future\u2014<strong>grad school, research programs, civil service exams</strong>, or <strong>early employment</strong>. Or take alternative paths: <strong>study abroad, deliver food, or simply coast through college life</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path comes with its own storylines, challenges, and choices. How you plan\u2014and how you act\u2014will shape the journey ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/c075246313d56ede51a9beab1be219db.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/80bc12150b70b80076de67d52695a8c1.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attend lectures</strong> in the classroom building, <strong>join research projects</strong> in the faculty halls, <strong>cram in the library</strong>, or <strong>scroll endlessly through dorm forums</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for the campus culture festival</strong> with your club, spend your summer <strong>doing internships or rural teaching</strong>, <strong>work part-time</strong> at convenience stores, race through the city <strong>delivering food</strong>, or <strong>binge-shop online</strong> during China\u2019s famous \u201cDouble Eleven\u201d sale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can imagine\u2014and more\u2014is here to be experienced.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/f633c091ef7ad90c3f3476bd8b666ecb.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1170 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.poster.avif?t=1773125094\" width=1054 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.webm?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/extras/bfdbb4797cd35821b4d1ff13965ebf7c.mp4?t=1773125094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your university journey, you\u2019ll encounter a diverse cast of characters, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and introverted roommate,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dazzling and accomplished senior,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and outgoing high school friend,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative and cultured peer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships through daily interactions on campus, evolving from acquaintances to close companions. As your bonds deepen, each character\u2019s unique storyline will unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond their personal arcs, these characters play key roles in both main and side storylines, growing alongside you as you shape your university experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind, Chill, or Burn Out \u2014 It\u2019s All Up to You</strong><br> Upgrade your stats through everyday choices. Balance classes, part-time jobs, social life, and rest.<br> <br><strong>Will you rise as a campus legend... or quietly fade into the background?  </strong><br> <br><br><strong>Your college story is yours to write.</strong></p>","developers":["HyCube"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898700/478790893e6ce577857d7f7db551cad8499c2f72/header.jpg?t=1773125094","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 4th Generation or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Integrated HD 6100+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest OSX Version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3GHz dual-core Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics 640<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer